{"availability":"available","full":"grahamaine/Pamoja","name":"Pamoja","description":"Pay when the service is done: Solana escrow for local service businesses in Uganda","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T06:27:52Z","updated":"2026-10-08T11:46:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pamoja-solana.vercel.app","topics":["anchor","east-africa","escrow","solana","vercel"],"demo":"https://pamoja-solana.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:17.442Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:17.442Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:17.442Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:17.442Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pay when the service is done. Pamoja is a Solana escrow app for local businesses in East Africa: salons, repairs, rides, food, shops and suppliers. A customer locks a payment, the provider does the job, and the money is released when the customer confirms with a short code.","Status: early prototype for the Encode Club Solana Hackathon 2026. The interface, payment API routes and the first on-chain instruction (createjob) exist. The escrow instructions that move money (fundjob, release, cancel, refund) are still being written, and the dashboard shows demo data."],"features":["Services and store categories (beauty, repairs, cleaning, construction, rides, food, delivery, shops and more), each with a job reference code.","Business dashboard preview (escrow balance, payouts, provider levels, embeddable \"Pay with Pamoja\" button).","Wallet connection: Phantom, Solflare and WalletConnect.","Payment routes for MTN MoMo, Airtel Money and Pesapal (card, bank, mobile money), plus a crypto option.","Supported-chains logo slideshow, mobile-first layout, Oswald typography."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/grahamaine/Pamoja/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b3551d66db1fc75853267422be553beeecbaf9f1eb71b18bda2c890424365e7